-| Electron / electron-vite / Vite | 42.11.15 / 6.0.0 / 8.3.4 |
-| React / React DOM / TypeScript | 19.3.1 / 19.3.1 / 5.9.3 |
-| better-sqlite3 / Zod | 12.11.1 / 4.6.7 |
-| Vitest / Playwright | 5.0.5 / 1.64.1 |
-| electron-builder / Prettier | 26.15.3 / 3.9.10 |
-| unified / remark-parse / remark-frontmatter | 11.0.5 / 11.0.0 / 5.0.0 |
